    "type": "question",
    "label": "5",
    "prompt": "Find the equation of the tangent to $y=\\sin(\\pi-x)$ at the point $\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6},\\frac12\\right)$ in exact general form.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$6\\sqrt3x-12y+6-\\pi\\sqrt3=0$",
      "worked": "$\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dy}{dx}&=-\\cos(\\pi-x)\\end{aligned}$\n\nAt $x=\\frac{\\pi}{6}$:\n\n$\\begin{aligned}m&=-\\cos\\left(\\pi-\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)\\\\&=-\\cos\\left(\\frac{5\\pi}{6}\\right)\\\\&=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}\\end{aligned}$\n\nTangent:\n\n$\\begin{aligned}y-\\frac12&=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}\\left(x-\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)\\\\12y-6&=6\\sqrt3x-\\pi\\sqrt3\\\\6\\sqrt3x-12y+6-\\pi\\sqrt3&=0\\end{aligned}$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 33
